1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.2;&quot;&gt;보조 제어: hold 요청 → 업무 gate 적용 ACK → 현재 의미로 reconciliation&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1045" y="745" width="790" height="15.6" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n191" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;rounded=0;fillColor=white;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.7;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1043" y="767" width="514.88" height="16.4" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n192" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.2;&quot;&gt;DISPATCHING 뒤 정정: 실제 외부 상태 조회 / 제어 / 발화 시작만으로 취소 완료 아님&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1045" y="768" width="790" height="14.399999999999999" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
